    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ghasobola okubaagho mu imwe omulanzi oba omuvuunuzi w'ebirooto, yaabasuubiza ekyewuunhio oba ekyewuninkiriza okubaagho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekyo aghanga okukikola ng'ayenda mutoolere okusinza bakatonda be mutasinzangaku. Aye ekirooto ekyo oba ekyewuninkiriza ekyo ky'asuubiiza ni bwe kituukiriranga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mutamuwulirisanga, kuba Musengwa Katonda waimwe aidha kubanga ng'ali kubaleba bulebe, abone oba nga mumugonza n'omutima gwaimwe gwonagwona, n'omwoyo gwaimwe gwonagwona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mujiirenga ku Musengwa Katonda waimwe by'abalagira, era mumutyenga. Mumuwulirenga era mukuumenga ebiragiro bye. Mumusinzenga era mubenga beesigwa y'ali ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye omulanzi oyo oba omuvuunuzi w'ebirooto oyo, aitibwenga, kuba abakoba kudheemera Musengwa Katonda waimwe, eyabatoola mu Misiri, ye mwakolanga obwiru. Omuntu ng'oti n'oyo aba ali kubadaaliimya okubatoola ku mpisa, Musengwa Katonda waimwe dhe yabalagira okugemanga, ky'anaavanga n'aitibwa, ni mwetoolaku ekibi ekyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ni bw'aba muganda wo mwene, oba mutabane wo, oba mughala wo, oba mukazi wo y'oyenda einho, oba mukagwa wo einho, yeena asobola okukusendasenda mu kyama ng'akukoba muje naye musinze bakatonda iwe ni badhaadha bo be mutasinzangaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Owundi ku abo asobola okukusendasenda okusinzanga bakatonda ab'amaghanga agabeezungulwire agho okumpi, oba ab'ago agabali eghala mu biketezo byonabyona eby'ensi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye iwe otaganhanga by'akukoba, oba okumuwulirisa, oba okumusaasira, waire okumuwonia ng'ogisa ekibi kye ekyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwitenga bwite! Era niiwe obe osookenga okumukuba okutoolereza okumwita, memale abandi boonaboona bamukubenga afe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oidha kumukubanga amabaale afe, kuba yagezaaku okukusendasenda ove ku Musengwa Katonda wo, eyakutoola mu Misiri, ye mwakolanga obwiru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agho Abaisiraeli boonaboona bwe banaawuliranga ekibairegho, baidha kutyanga. Olwo ghalobe kubaagho muntu wundi mu imwe airayo kukola kibi kyaga agho.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Bwe muba nga muli mu bibuga Musengwa Katonda waimwe by'ali kubagha, musobola okuwulira abantu nga babakobera bati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghaligho abantu ab'eighanga lyaimwe abadankaanu, abamaze okusendasenda abatyamye b'omu kibuga kyaibwe okusinza bakatonda be mutasinzangaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwe munaawuliranga olubono ng'oti n'olwo, munoonerezenga n'obwegendereza nga muli kubuuliriza ku ekyo. Era bwe kinaabanga nga kikakasiibwa nga kituufu, nti ekyenhinhalwa ekyaga agho kikoleibwa mu imwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwitenga bwite abatyamye ab'omu kibuga ekyo,n'ebyayo byaibwe, ekibuga mukisaaniengagho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebintu byonabyona eby'abantu baamu, munaabisolokezanga mu luguudo ghagati gh'ekibuga ekyo. Memale olwo mwayokya ekibuga ekyo n'ebintu byonabyona ebikirimu, byaba ekigheebwayo eri Musengwa Katonda waimwe nga kyokebwa. Ekibuga ekyo kinaasigalanga bifunfugu ebyanda n'ebyanda, era tikiirengamu kuzimbibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muteesigalizangayo kintu waire ekirala ku ebyo ebigheereibwayo okuzikirizibwa. Olwo Musengwa Katonda asobole okukomya obusungu bwe obubitirivu. Aidha kubagemerwanga ekivunika, abasaasire, era abafuule bangi nga bweyasuubiza badhaadha baimwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye muli n'okumuwuliranga, nga mukuuma ebiragiro bye byonabyona, bye ndi kubagha olwaleero, era nga mukola ebyo Musengwa Katonda waimwe by'abona nga n'ebituufu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.13.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
